ugh":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":89,"type":70,"url":14},{"id":92,"type":22,"rich_text":742},[743],{"type":25,"text":744,"annotations":746,"plain_text":745,"href":14},{"content":745,"link":14},"協助成大睡眠中心管理受測者的資料和數值，為了提升工作效率和資料解讀的精確性，對目前的系統進行前端及UI優化。\n\n通過圖表和顏色指示來呈現數據，使數據變得更生動且易於解讀。例如利用紅、黃、綠三種底色分別表示數值異常、數值稍有偏離正常範圍及數值正常。此方式能迅速告知使用者資料的狀態。",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":99,"type":99,"title":748},[749],{"type":25,"text":750,"annotations":752,"plain_text":751,"href":14},{"content":751,"link":14},"成大睡眠中心檢測系統｜CMS 系統",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":106,"type":107,"date":754},{"start":755,"end":14,"time_zone":14},"2021-06-01","https://www.notion.so/CMS-44cac5591bf640edb37b5fafe0f9f0d5",{"object":7,"id":758,"created_time":9,"last_edited_time":9,"created_by":759,"last_edited_by":760,"cover":14,"icon":14,"parent":761,"in_trash":18,"is_archived":18,"is_locked":18,"properties":762,"url":818,"public_url":14,"archived":18},"a2c1244f-57ac-4693-bb2b-76fbe907eef8",{"object":11,"id":12},{"object":11,"id":12},{"type":16,"database_id":17},{"Contributions":763,"Tags":769,"Cover":772,"Sort":777,"Skill":779,"LinkRemarks":787,"GitHub":789,"ProjectImage":790,"Client":797,"Link":802,"Text":803,"Name":809,"Update":815},{"id":21,"type":22,"rich_text":764},[765],{"type":25,"text":766,"annotations":768,"plain_text":767,"href":14},{"content":767,"link":14},"• 後端開發\n• 桌面應用程式開發\n• 農業資料開放平台系統串接\n• 資料庫設計",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":31,"type":32,"multi_select":770},[771],{"id":35,"name":36,"color":37},{"id":39,"type":40,"files":773},[774],{"name":775,"type":44,"external":776},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/AI4DT-Center-01.webp",{"url":775},{"id":47,"type":48,"number":778},11,{"id":51,"type":32,"multi_select":780},[781,782,783],{"id":54,"name":55,"color":56},{"id":721,"name":722,"color":656},{"id":784,"name":785,"color":786},"63b4a48c-9ef0-42db-b0a1-136bdec0576a","ASP.net","gray",{"id":62,"type":22,"rich_text":788},[],{"id":69,"type":70,"url":14},{"id":73,"type":40,"files":791},[792,794],{"name":775,"type":44,"external":793},{"url":775},{"name":795,"type":44,"external":796},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/AI4DT-Center-02.webp",{"url":795},{"id":82,"type":22,"rich_text":798},[799],{"type":25,"text":800,"annotations":801,"plain_text":738,"href":14},{"content":738,"link":14},{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":89,"type":70,"url":14},{"id":92,"type":22,"rich_text":804},[805],{"type":25,"text":806,"annotations":808,"plain_text":807,"href":14},{"content":807,"link":14},"透過食材供需集成平台，台灣中小學的午餐食材與菜單得到嚴格管理。平台串接農業資料，清晰展示食材資訊，並納入認證的章 Q 食材，確保學生享用新鮮健康的午餐。\n\n對偏鄉學校尤其有益，解決了因物流及供應問題所致的午餐品質挑戰。同時，示範案例庫提供學校優質供餐策略參考，升級整體午餐服務品質。",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":99,"type":99,"title":810},[811],{"type":25,"text":812,"annotations":814,"plain_text":813,"href":14},{"content":813,"link":14},"食材供需集成平台｜CMS 系統",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":106,"type":107,"date":816},{"start":817,"end":14,"time_zone":14},"2021-10-01","https://www.notion.so/CMS-a2c1244f57ac4693bb2b76fbe907eef8",{"object":7,"id":820,"created_time":9,"last_edited_time":9,"created_by":821,"last_edited_by":822,"cover":14,"icon":14,"parent":823,"in_trash":18,"is_archived":18,"is_locked":18,"properties":824,"url":879,"public_url":14,"archived":18},"205e4acd-35af-4f40-b5b1-869e0e01d258",{"object":11,"id":12},{"object":11,"id":12},{"type":16,"database_id":17},{"Contributions":825,"Tags":830,"Cover":833,"Sort":838,"Skill":840,"LinkRemarks":843,"GitHub":845,"ProjectImage":846,"Client":857,"Link":863,"Text":864,"Name":870,"Update":876},{"id":21,"type":22,"rich_text":826},[827],{"type":25,"text":828,"annotations":829,"plain_text":328,"href":14},{"content":328,"link":14},{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":31,"type":32,"multi_select":831},[832],{"id":271,"name":272,"color":273},{"id":39,"type":40,"files":834},[835],{"name":836,"type":44,"external":837},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/ITRI-price-cover.webp",{"url":836},{"id":47,"type":48,"number":839},12,{"id":51,"type":32,"multi_select":841},[842],{"id":54,"name":55,"color":56},{"id":62,"type":22,"rich_text":844},[],{"id":69,"type":70,"url":14},{"id":73,"type":40,"files":847},[848,851,854],{"name":849,"type":44,"external":850},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/ITRI-price-01.webp",{"url":849},{"name":852,"type":44,"external":853},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/ITRI-price-02.webp",{"url":852},{"name":855,"type":44,"external":856},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/ITRI-price-03.webp",{"url":855},{"id":82,"type":22,"rich_text":858},[859],{"type":25,"text":860,"annotations":862,"plain_text":861,"href":14},{"content":861,"link":14},"ITRI",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":89,"type":70,"url":14},{"id":92,"type":22,"rich_text":865},[866],{"type":25,"text":867,"annotations":869,"plain_text":868,"href":14},{"content":868,"link":14},"消費者在電商平台上購物時，常面對眾多的選擇與價格差異，工研院為此設計了一套系統，運用爬蟲技術，即時抓取電商平台上(如 momo、蝦皮)的商品價格資訊，讓消費者能夠在一個網頁上快速比較同一商品在不同平台上的價格。\n\n考慮到目前的消費模式，手機已經成為最主要的瀏覽和購物工具。為了不增加消費者的操作負擔，工研院特地設計了一個專為手機使用者體驗優化的比價網頁，而非一個需另外下載的APP。",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":99,"type":99,"title":871},[872],{"type":25,"text":873,"annotations":875,"plain_text":874,"href":14},{"content":874,"link":14},"工研院比價爬蟲專案｜線上工具",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":106,"type":107,"date":877},{"start":878,"end":14,"time_zone":14},"2022-04-01","https://www.notion.so/205e4acd35af4f40b5b1869e0e01d258",{"object":7,"id":881,"created_time":9,"last_edited_time":9,"created_by":882,"last_edited_by":883,"cover":14,"icon":14,"parent":884,"in_trash":18,"is_archived":18,"is_locked":18,"properties":885,"url":937,"public_url":14,"archived":18},"323afa84-5821-4fbb-a76f-150b8014ac12",{"object":11,"id":12},{"object":11,"id":12},{"type":16,"database_id":17},{"Contributions":886,"Tags":892,"Cover":895,"Sort":900,"Skill":902,"LinkRemarks":906,"GitHub":908,"ProjectImage":909,"Client":916,"Link":921,"Text":922,"Name":928,"Update":934},{"id":21,"type":22,"rich_text":887},[888],{"type":25,"text":889,"annotations":891,"plain_text":890,"href":14},{"content":890,"link":14},"• 後端開發\n• 資料視覺化",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":31,"type":32,"multi_select":893},[894],{"id":35,"name":36,"color":37},{"id":39,"type":40,"files":896},[897],{"name":898,"type":44,"external":899},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/iNCKU-airbox-01.webp",{"url":898},{"id":47,"type":48,"number":901},13,{"id":51,"type":32,"multi_select":903},[904,905],{"id":54,"name":55,"color":56},{"id":721,"name":722,"color":656},{"id":62,"type":22,"rich_text":907},[],{"id":69,"type":70,"url":14},{"id":73,"type":40,"files":910},[911,913],{"name":898,"type":44,"external":912},{"url":898},{"name":914,"type":44,"external":915},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/iNCKU-airbox-02.webp",{"url":914},{"id":82,"type":22,"rich_text":917},[918],{"type":25,"text":919,"annotations":920,"plain_text":738,"href":14},{"content":738,"link":14},{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":89,"type":70,"url":14},{"id":92,"type":22,"rich_text":923},[924],{"type":25,"text":925,"annotations":927,"plain_text":926,"href":14},{"content":926,"link":14},"成大的空氣盒子不僅是一款微型空氣感測器，該感測器所體現的「參與式感測」與「開放資料」理念，鼓勵公眾參與空氣品質的監測與改善。\n\n本專案的主要目標是利用這些開放的實時數據，提供一個直觀的平台供使用者查詢。我們將複雜的空氣質量數據轉化為容易理解的圖表和指標。不僅如此，這些圖表還能深入揭示二氧化碳量等多項重要指標，幫助使用者即時了解其所處環境的空氣狀態。",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":99,"type":99,"title":929},[930],{"type":25,"text":931,"annotations":933,"plain_text":932,"href":14},{"content":932,"link":14},"成大空氣盒子專案｜CMS 系統",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":106,"type":107,"date":935},{"start":936,"end":14,"time_zone":14},"2021-11-01","https://www.notion.so/CMS-323afa8458214fbba76f150b8014ac12",{"object":7,"id":939,"created_time":9,"last_edited_time":9,"created_by":940,"last_edited_by":941,"cover":14,"icon":14,"parent":942,"in_trash":18,"is_archived":18,"is_locked":18,"properties":943,"url":1004,"public_url":14,"archived":18},"afaca725-0f43-4731-abf9-177b12fd66c2",{"object":11,"id":12},{"object":11,"id":12},{"type":16,"database_id":17},{"Contributions":944,"Tags":950,"Cover":953,"Sort":958,"Skill":960,"LinkRemarks":963,"GitHub":965,"ProjectImage":966,"Client":983,"Link":989,"Text":990,"Name":996,"Update":1002},{"id":21,"type":22,"rich_text":945},[946],{"type":25,"text":947,"annotations":949,"plain_text":948,"href":14},{"content":948,"link":14},"• 模型串接\n• 後端開發",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":31,"type":32,"multi_select":951},[952],{"id":271,"name":272,"color":273},{"id":39,"type":40,"files":954},[955],{"name":956,"type":44,"external":957},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/odoo-theft-prevention-cover.webp",{"url":956},{"id":47,"type":48,"number":959},14,{"id":51,"type":32,"multi_select":961},[962],{"id":207,"name":208,"color":37},{"id":62,"type":22,"rich_text":964},[],{"id":69,"type":70,"url":14},{"id":73,"type":40,"files":967},[968,971,974,977,980],{"name":969,"type":44,"external":970},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/odoo-theft-prevention-01.webp",{"url":969},{"name":972,"type":44,"external":973},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/odoo-theft-prevention-02.webp",{"url":972},{"name":975,"type":44,"external":976},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/odoo-theft-prevention-03.webp",{"url":975},{"name":978,"type":44,"external":979},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/odoo-theft-prevention-04.webp",{"url":978},{"name":981,"type":44,"external":982},"https://dcomb-web.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/webp/odoo-theft-prevention-05.webp",{"url":981},{"id":82,"type":22,"rich_text":984},[985],{"type":25,"text":986,"annotations":988,"plain_text":987,"href":14},{"content":987,"link":14},"KKDay Inc",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":89,"type":70,"url":14},{"id":92,"type":22,"rich_text":991},[992],{"type":25,"text":993,"annotations":995,"plain_text":994,"href":14},{"content":994,"link":14},"Odoo 是一款流行的企業資源規劃（ERP）軟體，支持多種業務流程。近年來，隨著線上交易的普及，盜刷問題日益嚴重。為了解決此問題，我們應業主要求開發了基於Odoo的盜刷偵測插件。\n\n這個插件串接AI大數據模型，分析大量訂單的數據特徵，進行快速的盜刷風險評估。在AI的初步評估基礎上，只需少量的人工審查，便可大大降低盜刷風險。",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":99,"type":99,"title":997},[998],{"type":25,"text":999,"annotations":1001,"plain_text":1000,"href":14},{"content":1000,"link":14},"Odoo 盜刷預測系統｜線上工具",{"bold":18,"italic":18,"strikethrough":18,"underline":18,"code":18,"color":29},{"id":106,"type":107,"date":1003},{"start":253,"end":14,"time_zone":14},"https://www.notion.so/Odoo-afaca7250f434731abf9177b12fd66c2","page_or_database",{},"9448c3b6-97e7-43f6-9ffd-2e74e7339149",{"object":7,"id":758,"created_time":9,"last_edited_time":9,"created_by":1009,"last_edited_by":1010,"cover":14,"icon":14,"parent":1011,"in_trash":18,"is_archived":18,"is_locked":18,"properties":1012,"url":818,"public_url":14,"archived":18,"request_id":1058},{"object":11,"id":12},{"object":11,"id":12},{"type":16,"database_id":17},{"Contributions":1013,"Tags":1018,"Cover":1021,"Sort":1025,"Skill":1026,"LinkRemarks":1031,"GitHub":1033,"ProjectImage":1034,"Client":1040,"Link":1045,"Text":1046,"Name":1051,"Update":1056},{"id":21,"type":22,"rich_text":1014},[1015],{"type":25,"text